tle=\"sick person\">sick person</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/spokesperson#English\" title=\"spokesperson\">spokesperson</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/stateless_person#English\" title=\"stateless person\">stateless person</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/stuntperson#English\" title=\"stuntperson\">stuntperson</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/tadpole_person#English\" title=\"tadpole person\">tadpole person</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/third_person#English\" title=\"third person\">third person</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/unperson#English\" title=\"unperson\">unperson</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/VIP#English\" title=\"VIP\">VIP</a></span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"list-switcher-element\"><span class=\"NavToggle\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">show more ▼</a></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Derived_terms\">Derived terms</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=person&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Derived terms\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"list-switcher-wrapper\"><div class=\"list-switcher list-switcher-collapsed\" data-toggle-category=\"derived terms\"><div class=\"term-list columns-bg ul-column-count\" data-column-count=\"5\"><ul><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/about_one%27s_person#English\" title=\"about one's person\">about one's person</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/adperson#English\" title=\"adperson\">adperson</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/ambulanceperson#English\" 